# Optional. Leave unset for the default, fully on-device Mode A.
# Self-host the Whisper model files and point to them (path template: {model}/resolve/main/):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MODEL_HOST=https://models.your-domain.example/
# Experimental on-device LLM refinement (WebGPU). Off by default. Not Mode-A-clean unless its files are self-hosted.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_LLM=1
